      "designInstructions": "# Aerospace Terminal Design Language\n\nThe design is inspired by tactical aerospace HUDs and industrial terminal interfaces, characterized by high-contrast dark surfaces and technical line work.\n\n### 1. Layout & Composition\n- **Atmospheric Void**: Use `void` (#000000) as the primary background. Containers and cards use `optical` (#050505) with razor-sharp borders.\n- **HUD Overlays**: A global CRT scanline effect (subtle linear gradient overlay) should be applied to the viewport to reinforce the hardware-terminal feel.\n- **Symmetry & Grids**: Elements are aligned to a strict 12-column grid with generous internal padding, emphasizing structured data over organic shapes.\n\n### 2. Border & Shape Eccentricities\n- **Target Boxes**: Every major container uses a \"target-box\" style: transparent background with 2px thick L-shaped corner accents in `sensor` (#00E5FF). \n- **Hover Transitions**: On interaction, these corner accents expand and shift to `target` (#FF003C), accompanied by a subtle inner glow.\n- **Button HUDs**: Buttons are rectangular with 1px industrial borders, using monospaced uppercase labels.\n\n### 3. Decorative Motifs\n- **Crosshair Cursor**: The entire interface uses a `crosshair` cursor, enhancing the tactical/precision theme.\n- **Numbering**: Section headers are prefixed with technical indices (e.g., `01.`, `02.`) in `target` red.\n- **Rule Lines**: Use 1px thin horizontal rules (`h-px`) in muted tones for structural separation.\n\n### 4. Typography\n- **Headings**: `Michroma` in `sensor` cyan, always uppercase with wide tracking for a futuristic command-center aesthetic.\n- **Data/Body**: `Share Tech Mono` for all body copy and UI labels, maintaining the feeling of a real-time data readout.\n\n### 5. Interaction Feel\n- **Animation**: Entrance animations are snappy and linear. Elements should slide up or fade in with a technical \"boot sequence\" feel.\n- **Interactive States**: Hovering over interactive cards (`target-box`) triggers a slight scale increase (1.02x) and a shift from cool `sensor` cyan to aggressive `target` red accents.",
      "created": "2026-06-13T16:02:15.380194+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-06-13T16:02:15.380194+00:00"
    }
